{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["profile:write"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Review company profile changes"},"description":"Prepare matching-profile changes for the user to review and approve. Requires the revision from get_company_profile. Preserve unknown facts; do not invent qualifications. Does not start a trial or change email preferences. Returns change_id, operation, pending status, expires_at, summary, review_url and message. No change applies until the user approves the exact proposal in the signed-in browser. Use change_id with get_change_status afterwards; errors return error and message.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"changes":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Only supplied matching-profile fields change. Omitted fields remain saved; null clears nullable text. Supply verified company facts, not inferred qualifications.","properties":{"clearance_capability":{"description":"Clearances the company can evidence","items":{"maxLength":40,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":5,"type":"array"},"company_name":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Trading company name"},"company_number":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":40,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Official company registration number from the relevant company register or saved profile. Preserve leading zeros; do not infer it from the company name."},"frameworks":{"description":"Framework memberships actually held","items":{"maxLength":40,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":15,"type":"array"},"keywords":{"description":"Specific service and matching phrases","items":{"maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"legal_name":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Registered legal na